## What this repo is

KOReader Lua plugin (`AnkiKOAi.koplugin/`). Highlights → Wiki / Vocabulary / Memorization
cards → AnkiConnect → desktop Anki. All plugin logic is `*.lua` at the repo root.

---

## Module map (main `.lua` files)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `main.lua` | Entry, highlight hooks, wiki/vocab/mem flows, auto-send tick |
| `card_defaults.lua` | **Central API** for per-type decks, models, auto-send flags |
| `card_fields.lua` | Field normalization, settings migration |
| `card_storage.lua` | `ankikooai_cards.json`, `ankikooai_settings.json` |
| `settings_viewer.lua` | Settings UI (Menu + gray help rows, Card defaults, Where cards go, AI, sync) |
| `plugin_menu.lua` | AnkiKOAi hub menu from highlight dialog |
| `send_flow.lua` / `anki_sync.lua` | Send + AnkiConnect HTTP |
| `deck_picker.lua` / `note_type_picker.lua` | Pick from Anki lists |
| `card_generator.lua` | AI Wiki Card generation |
| `dictionary_lookup.lua` | Vocabulary Card dictionary path |
| `poetry_memorize.lua` | Memorization split + send |
| `highlight_inbox.lua` | Batch highlight flows; **Switch book** in View All Highlights |
| `highlight_books.lua` | ReadHistory + sidecar discovery for cross-book inbox |
| `card_manager.lua` | My Cards, manage, send-all-unsent, `send_batch_items` |

---

## Settings architecture (on device)

**Settings → Card defaults** — each card type has **note type + deck** (Anki pickers):

- **Wiki Card…** — `wiki_note_type`, `wiki_deck`, `wiki_card_hub_label`, `auto_send_wiki`
- **Vocabulary Card…** — `vocabulary_model`, `vocabulary_deck`, `vocabulary_card_hub_label`, dictionary, `auto_send_vocabulary`
- **Memorization Card…** — `memorize_model`, `memorize_parent_deck`, one-tap / quick button
- **Where cards go…** — `subdeck_by_book`, `per_book_decks` (**not** default decks; Wiki/Vocabulary only)
- **Deck picker shortcuts…** — `favorite_decks`, `recent_decks` (manual send only)

**Settings menus** use `Menu` with subtitle `SETTINGS_HELP_SUBTITLE` (`Tap gray rows for help.`) and `info_menu_item()` for dim tappable help rows. In-app guide: `docs/in-app/settings-ui.md` (`readme_viewer` id `settings`).

**Hub labels:** `CardDefaults.wiki_hub_label(config)` / `vocabulary_hub_label(config)` — empty `wiki_card_hub_label` / `vocabulary_card_hub_label` → `PluginConstants` defaults. Used in `plugin_menu.lua`, `highlight_inbox.lua`.

**Prompts & suffix** (`settings_viewer.lua` → `show_prompts`): Menu (not ButtonDialog); always edits `wiki_note_type`; `prompt_edit_model` synced on save. **View default** = `PromptBuilder.preview_*_builtin` (built-in template only); **Preview effective** = `preview_generate` / `preview_regen`.

**Batch send** (`card_manager.lua`): `send_all_unsent` / `send_batch_items` → `AnkiSync.send_card_with_status` (duplicate → reconcile; network timeout → `note_exists_in_deck` verify). Manual batch shows **Sending… N/M** via `Notification` (`show_batch_progress`); gated with `not opts.background` (WiFi auto-send in `main.lua` stays silent). Reconcile via `CardReconcile.finish` → `record_recent_sent` + `delete_matching_card` + per-type highlight policy.

**Check against Anki** (`CardManager.check_items_against_anki`): read-only `findNotes` via `resolve_deck_name` + Phrase; found → `CardReconcile.finish` status `checked`. My Cards: Check pending / Check Selected.

**Recently sent:** `ankikooai_recent_sent.json`, max 50 entries; not synced in v1 (`card_sync.lua` unchanged).

Use `CardDefaults.*` in code; do not read raw `config.deck` except as legacy fallback inside `card_defaults.lua`.

